            "authorAssociation": "MEMBER",
            "body": "It should be possible by [using function `header` or `footer`](https://github.com/echasnovski/mini.nvim/blob/22a7bcc9e67a86379e95edf00f62ed643f48f5e0/doc/mini-starter.txt#L226-L234). How to get the exact startup time is up to the user here (no built-in 'mini.starter' support for that).",
            "bodyHTML": "<p dir=\"auto\">It should be possible by <a href=\"https://github.com/echasnovski/mini.nvim/blob/22a7bcc9e67a86379e95edf00f62ed643f48f5e0/doc/mini-starter.txt#L226-L234\">using function <code class=\"notranslate\">header</code> or <code class=\"notranslate\">footer</code></a>. How to get the exact startup time is up to the user here (no built-in 'mini.starter' support for that).</p>",
